   "none": "no reference held"
  },
  "crops": "docs/reference/crops/<n>.jpg, cut from the page scan at the decided rectangle, tightened to drop bare paper and the printed figure number, long side 900 px",
  "captions": "transcribed from the caption block at the foot of the even page of each spread; the book's own spellings, and the italic J the DjVu layer reads as an F put back",
  "credit": "credit is the photographer the Ozma book names for the photograph. licence describes the Wikimedia scan only, and is present only where there is one.",
  "reference_images_never_feed_the_decode": true
